    -- [1] Fixed under threat: shatter + a_dropout
    shatter_event fixed_under_threat ∧ a_dropout fixed_under_threat ∧
    -- [2] Fixed stable: false_lock + a_dropout (fragile, contingent)
    false_lock fixed_stable ∧ a_dropout fixed_stable ∧
